## 4. Deep Architectural Intel (`get_repo_deep_intel`)

Provides an instant, consolidated view of an assimilated repository without needing to grep Markdown docs:

```python
from core.registry.repo_catalog import get_repo_deep_intel

intel = get_repo_deep_intel("gvclab/personalive")
# Returns:
# {
#     "id": "gvclab/personalive",
#     "name": "personalive",
#     "maturity_tier": "Tier 1: Golden Core",
#     "assigned_agent": "gerych_researcher",
#     "dnk_module_target": "core/engine",
#     "license_track": "Track 1: Permissive",
#     "architectural_pattern": "Extracted SOTA reference architecture...",
#     "what_it_gives": "Reference algorithms...",
#     "is_assimilated": True,
#     "sota_doc": "docs/tech/sota_assimilation/SOTA_PERSONALIVE_ASSIMILATION.md",
#     "attached_skill": "personalive_assimilated",
#     "github_url": "https://github.com/gvclab/personalive"
# }
```

