## 5. CLI & Pydantic Fast-Path

### Command-Line Querying
```bash
# Query Tier 1 repositories by intent
./.venv/bin/python scripts/system/dnk_repo_search.py "Liquid блоки" --tier 1

# Inspect Deep Intel card for an assimilated repository
./.venv/bin/python scripts/system/dnk_repo_search.py --intel gvclab/personalive

# Machine-readable JSON output for swarm agents
./.venv/bin/python scripts/system/dnk_repo_search.py "пам'ять" --limit 5 --json
```

### Pydantic Schemas (`core/kernel/contracts.py`)
- `RepoSearchRequest`: query, maturity_tier, assigned_agent, category, domain, tag, limit (1-100), offset, include_intel.
- `RepoSearchResultItem`: id, name, description, maturity_tier, assigned_agent, dnk_module_target, license_track, score, deep_intel.
- `RepoSearchResponse`: total_count, returned_count, query, expanded_query, results, execution_time_ms.
